<title>USA: Colonial BancGroup in 686,000 share buyback.</title>
<headline>Colonial BancGroup in 686,000 share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MONTGOMERY, Ala. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colonial BancGroup Inc said Tuesday it will buy back up to 686,000 shares of its common stock, 1.76 percent of outstanding shares, to be used for the previously announced purchase of First Commerce Banks of Winter Haven, Fla.</p>
<p>The company said that at current market prices, the cost of the repurchase would be about $16 million. Colonial was trading at 23-1/2, up 5/8.</p>
<p>The company also said it expects to close the acquisition of First Commerce during the third quarter of 1997.</p>
</text>
